    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"922\"><em data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"922\">3rd Level)</em></p><p><strong>Administrative Pressure:</strong> +3</p><p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1012\">You identify unstable divinity: feral tulpas, corrupted contracts, rogue manifestations.</p><p data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1079\">As an action, mark a target <strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1063\">Out of Compliance</strong> for this scene.</p><h3 data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1109\">While Out of Compliance:</h3><ul data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1321\"><li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1249\"><p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1162\">Your suppression, banishment, and disable effects:</p><ul data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1249\"><li data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1188\"><p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1188\">reroll the lowest die <strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1188\">or</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1249\"><p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1249\">Add your Civic Charge die result to the DC (your choice)</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1321\"><p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1321\">Violations of contracts or major precedents trigger Auditor features.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1376\">Only one creature may be Out of Compliance at a time.</p><h3 data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1386\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1420\">No Civic Charge required to mark.</p><h3 data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1434\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1496\">Marking politically protected entities may generate backlash.</p>",
